## Evidence and boundaries

The134234fixture passed visual pixels, compact geometry, same HWND/styles, fake answer/transcript
continuation, state restoration and fresh in-process peer traversal. cachedPeerValueReadable=true:
retained data is not secret from an already-held reference. No real audio/model/capture probe ran.
The later135359fixture also confirms PeekPreventionRequested=true after native setter success;
actual taskbar-hover/recipient behavior remains unqualified. Final screenshot provenance records
the current exact source/assembly hashes.
Final140313fixture passes all15cover assertions after the generic accessible Uncover label.
Process/window enumeration, memory, cached external clients, hardware capture and recipient
qualification remain outside any invisibility claim. No drivers, hooks, process disguise,
global accessibility disable or recorder/security-tool interference.

